{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an employee assigned to a remote train station during a disaster that no one dares to name</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will experience the first nights of survival, reviewing and approving train reports to determine which trains are safe to pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the longer you stay, the stranger the station becomes. Shadows move where no one stands, and visitors appear who shouldn\u2019t exist. You\u2019ll start to question what is real\u2014and what is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initial Nights of Survival:</strong> Play the first few nights and get a taste of the tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Report System:</strong> Approve or reject trains based on changing details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Encounter hallucinations that blur reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape, Don\u2019t Fight:</strong> Avoid threats\u2014you cannot confront them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it through the first nights?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995150?t=1757298645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995150?t=1757298645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995150/138dde02c0f06c4a3fc2bee23fde5ea156d47f7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757298645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995150/138dde02c0f06c4a3fc2bee23fde5ea156d47f7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757298645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives",